{"id":"r82st5pr6tsx9e5affya17jmn","title":"申万银行指数总市值创新高及机构2027年布局分析","originalTitle":"再创新高！银行板块逆势大涨 2027年如何布局？","summary":"11月13日A股银行板块逆势走强，申万银行指数总市值达17.45万亿元创历史新高，较年内低点累计上涨23.1%。北向资金三季度增持银行股至2106亿元，公募基金主动持仓比例升至2.16%。中信建投、浙商证券等机构认为2027年银行板块配置需关注房价企稳对信贷需求的影响，当前板块市净率0.7倍、股息率4%-5%仍具吸引力。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"东方财富"},"links":{"original":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1354,202611143931111515.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T23:26:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T01:17:13.982Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T01:17:13.982Z","category":"stock-cn","tags":["行情异动","财报"],"score":69,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"1baca3d8-9196-420d-98ee-d0afc15b592b","title":"银行板块总市值创历史新高"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"1baca3d8-9196-420d-98ee-d0afc15b592b","title":"银行板块总市值创历史新高"}],"topics":[{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"},{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fmpqVDyUbT30","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}